      "sourceTextSha256": "228fa30015034e7d8fb05fe0229ea9ffab14c9ba86db9ed8e3b291ffc0e184ed",
      "text": "Rio de Janeiro and Búzios combine two of Brazil’s most captivating destinations in a journey that blends iconic landmarks, breathtaking scenery and time to relax at your own pace. Discover Rio’s world-famous attractions, including Christ the Redeemer and Sugar Loaf, admire its spectacular coastline and enjoy free time to explore. Then continue to the charming peninsula of Búzios, a former fishing village transformed into one of Brazil’s most exclusive seaside resorts, with crystal-clear water, more than twenty beautiful beaches and a lively gastronomic scene.",
